  "details": "Be able to limit user ranks to join a group public instance. Since crasher Avis and Skids are still a major issue. I think being able to limit Visitor accounts from joining the instance or allowing only certain accounts to join/see the instance. \n\nAge Verification. If there is a way to Verify ID similar to how IMVU does it (never used IMVU tbh). But where we would get an 18+ tag added for a 1 time payment or something to take up the cost of implementing a service like Veriff  and you can limit certain private group instances to just people with said tag. I think that would be a safety thing as well and people with 18+ tag can have additional features. \n\nWe just need more ways we can secure our group instances from bad actors.\n\nAlso as always sending messages text or audio messages would be nice...",
